usage: module-nav callers [-h] [-n N] class_name [method]

positional arguments:
  class_name  Class name (e.g. BLinkPad)
  method      Method name (e.g. setPreferredSize); omit for every method of the class: per-method
              caller counts, then the call sites

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
  -n N        Max results (default 50)
